<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1407341182"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1611526610"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Starlight"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="B3LLA / Reichuu"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Starlight"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:08.080"><div begin="00:16.620" end="03:08.080"><p begin="00:16.620" end="00:19.950" itunes:key="L1">Though all the stars are shining in the sky<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管夜空繁星璀璨如许</span></p><p begin="00:19.950" end="00:22.750" itunes:key="L2">The only light that I pay mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我眼中只倒映着唯一的光明</span></p><p begin="00:22.750" end="00:25.580" itunes:key="L3">Is the precious sparkle in your eyes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是你眼眸中跃动的珍贵星芒</span></p><p begin="00:25.580" end="00:28.870" itunes:key="L4">When you smiled at me that night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那夜你向我微笑时的模样</span></p><p begin="00:28.870" end="00:31.660" itunes:key="L5">The both of us locked in a gaze<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们在黑暗中凝望彼此</span></p><p begin="00:31.660" end="00:34.280" itunes:key="L6">Amidst the dark and wretched haze<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿过重重阴霾与迷雾</span></p><p begin="00:34.280" end="00:37.360" itunes:key="L7">As long as you're still shining bright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要你的光芒依旧闪耀</span></p><p begin="00:37.360" end="00:42.220" itunes:key="L8">With all our might we'll reach out for the light<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们将竭尽全力追寻光明</span></p><p begin="00:42.220" end="00:45.110" itunes:key="L9">Stay by my side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请留在我身旁</span></p><p begin="00:45.110" end="00:48.150" itunes:key="L10">Don't give up the fight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别放弃这场战斗</span></p><p begin="00:48.150" end="00:53.740" itunes:key="L11">Despite the torture we will endure<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使要承受万千煎熬</span></p><p begin="00:53.740" end="00:56.880" itunes:key="L12">Without this pain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若没有这般痛楚</span></p><p begin="00:56.880" end="01:29.050" itunes:key="L13">There won't be gain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又何来收获的甘甜</span></p><p begin="01:29.050" end="01:31.690" itunes:key="L14">I sit and stare at the city lights<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我静坐凝望城市灯火</span></p><p begin="01:31.690" end="01:34.520" itunes:key="L15">So bright, drowned in night, it set my heart alight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">璀璨淹没于夜色 却点燃我心焰</span></p><p begin="01:34.520" end="01:37.880" itunes:key="L16">But it's not quite alive despite the delight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使欢愉也难掩死寂</span></p><p begin="01:37.880" end="01:40.330" itunes:key="L17">But we will reunite<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我们终将重逢</span></p><p begin="01:40.330" end="01:43.080" itunes:key="L18">So entrust your all to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请将一切托付于我</span></p><p begin="01:43.080" end="01:46.950" itunes:key="L19">Don't you see everything we can be<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难道你看不见我们的未来可期</span></p><p begin="01:46.950" end="01:52.530" itunes:key="L20">So won't you be mine throughout our journey<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿与我共赴这场漫长旅程吗</span></p><p begin="01:52.530" end="01:54.710" itunes:key="L21">Oh, oh</p><p begin="02:05.170" end="02:08.180" itunes:key="L22">Stay by my side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请留在我身旁</span></p><p begin="02:08.180" end="02:11.160" itunes:key="L23">Don't give up the fight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别放弃这场战斗</span></p><p begin="02:11.160" end="02:26.560" itunes:key="L24">Despite the torture we will endure<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使要承受万千煎熬</span></p><p begin="02:26.560" end="02:28.860" itunes:key="L25">Let me see</p><p begin="02:28.860" end="03:08.080" itunes:key="L26">Your smile for me</p></div></body></tt>